# VestCross frontend — copy to .env (never commit .env)
# The app reads live schedule state from the VestCrossV2 deployment on
# QoreChain Diana through @qorechain/evm. The live v2 address
# (0x64ab1fABEA011CA0395Ad835EC38B590CF76C295, deployed 2026-11-16) is
# built in as the default; set VITE_VESTCROSS_ADDRESS only to override it.
# VITE_VESTCROSS_ADDRESS=0x64ab1fABEA011CA0395Ad835EC38B590CF76C295
# VITE_EVM_RPC_URL=https://evm-testnet.qore.host
